Vnum            10912
Name            核心魄淵座~
Description
魄淵座像整個核心外層最後的立足邊界，腳下只剩持續向下抽離的幽赤暗潮，任何聲音落下去都像被更深層存在慢慢吞沒。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        10911
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        11001
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         魄淵~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
